s a linear action-horror shooter about loss, survival, and the will to fight back. <br>You play as Sarah Caldwell, a former soldier trying to reconnect with a friend .. but the night has other plans. The city slips into darkness. People disappear. Blood paints the sidewalks. And something.. looms in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her father might be in danger. The world feels like it\u2019s ending. All she has is an old rifle, her training, and a promise she\u2019s not willing to break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just survival. It\u2019s a last stand. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920120/extras/0aac7be97599a8f9e007fa5951ffcbbd.poster.avif?t=1764787863\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920120/extras/0aac7be97599a8f9e007fa5951ffcbbd.webm?t=1764787863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920120/extras/0aac7be97599a8f9e007fa5951ffcbbd.mp4?t=1764787863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight, linear campaign</strong> : No filler. Just raw action, eerie tension, and story-driven progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic atmosphere</strong> : Dynamic lighting, haunting environments, and a world falling apart around you.. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920120/extras/9aac97d59942ad0d35dee56aa113bf2f.poster.avif?t=1764787863\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920120/extras/9aac97d59942ad0d35dee56aa113bf2f.webm?t=1764787863\" type=\"video/webm; codec